mandown
------------------------------------------
Need to lookup things from README? Or from manual page? Or perhaps just want to
install something cool...

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libconfig15-1.8.3-1bl1
  libncursesw10-6.5+20240427-1
  libxml2_2-2.13.9-3

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libconfig-devel-1.8.3-1bl1
  libncurses-devel-6.5+20240427-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-3
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/Titor8115/mandown

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/Titor8115/mandown/archive/refs/tags/v1.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mandown-1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mandown-1.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mandown-1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mandown-1.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(mandown)
  /usr/bin/mdn.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/mandown.README
  /usr/share/doc/mandown/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/mandown/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/mandown/screenshot.png

